gth}</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className="bg-red-50 p-6 rounded-lg">\n                        <p className="text-sm text-red-700 font-semibold">Closed-Lost</p>\n                        <p className="text-3xl font-bold text-red-900">{leads.filter(l => l.status === \'Closed-Lost\').length}</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </Card>\n        )}\n\n        {/* Bottom Sections */}\n        <div className="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">\n            <Card>\n                <div className="p-6">\n                    <h3 className="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Best Practices</h3>\n                    <ul className="space-y-3 text-slate-600">\n                        <li className="flex items-start"><span className="text-orange-500 mr-2 mt-1">◆</span><span><strong>Quick Response:</strong> Aim to contact new leads within 5 minutes.</span></li>\n                        <li className="flex items-start"><span className="text-orange-500 mr-2 mt-1">◆</span><span><strong>Consistent Follow-up:</strong> Schedule at least 5-7 follow-ups for each lead.</span></li>\n                        <li className="flex items-start"><span className="text-orange-500 mr-2 mt-1">◆</span><span><strong>Personalization:</strong> Reference lead\'s specific interests or company details.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </Card>\n            <Card>\n                <div className="p-6">\n                    <h3 className="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Integration Advice</h3>\n                    <div className="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">\n                        {[ { Icon: Mail, name: \'Email\' }, { Icon: Calendar, name: \'Calendar\' }, { Icon: Phone, name: \'Telephony\' }, { Icon: BarChart2, name: \'Marketing\' } ].map(({ Icon, name }) => (\n                            <div key={name} className="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors">\n          