ode would be a fantastic addition for late-night browsing. Is this something the development team is considering?\',\n    author: sampleUsers[1],\n    timestamp: \'3 days ago\',\n    category: \'Suggestions\',\n    replies: [],\n  },\n    {\n    id: 6,\n    title: \'Introduce Yourself!\',\n    content: \'Welcome to all new members! Use this thread to say hello and tell us a bit about yourself. What are your interests? What brings you to our community?\',\n    author: sampleUsers[0],\n    timestamp: \'1 week ago\',\n    category: \'Introductions\',\n    replies: [],\n  },\n];\n\n// --- SUB-COMPONENTS --- //\n\nconst Avatar: FC<{ user: UserProfile }> = ({ user }) => (\n  <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-200 border-2 border-slate-300 overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0">\n    {user.avatar}\n  </div>\n);\n\nconst Header: FC<{ onNewPostClick: () => void, searchTerm: string, setSearchTerm: (s: string) => void }> = ({ onNewPostClick, searchTerm, setSearchTerm }) => {\n  const [isDropdownOpen, setDropdownOpen] = useState(false);\n\n  return (\n    <header className="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-lg sticky top-0 z-30 border-b border-slate-200">\n      <div className="container mx-auto px-4">\n        <div className="flex items-center justify-between h-16">\n          <div className="flex items-center space-x-8">\n            <div className="flex items-center space-x-2 text-slate-800">\n                <div className="bg-slate-800 p-2 rounded-lg">\n                    <ChevronsRight className="w-5 h-5 text-slate-50" />\n                </div>\n                <span className="font-bold text-xl">Forum Hub</span>\n            </div>\n            <nav className="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-6">\n              {[\'Browse\', \'User Center\'].map(item => (\n                <a key={item} href="#" className="text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 font-medium transition-colors">\n                  {item}\n                </a>\n              ))}\n            </nav>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className="flex items-center space-x-4">\n            <div className="relative hidden sm:block">\n              <Search className="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-5 h-5 text-slate-400" />\n              <input\n                type="text"\n                placeholder="Search..."\n                value={searchTerm}\n                onChange={(e) => setSearchTerm(e.target.value)}\n                className="pl-10 pr-4 py-2 w-40 md:w-64 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-transparent focus:bg-white focus:border-slate-300 focus:outline-none transition-all"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <button\n              onClick={onNewPostClick}\n              className="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-700 text-white rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-sm"\n            >\n              <Plus className="w-4 h-4" />\n              New Post\n            </button>\n            <div className="relative">\n              <button onClick={() => setDropdownOpen(!isDropdownOpen)} className="flex items-center space-x-2">\n                <Avatar user={defaultUser} />\n                <ChevronDown className={cn(\'w-4 h-4 text-slate-500 transition-transform\', isDropdownOpen && \'rotate-180\')} />\n              </button>\n              {isDropdownOpen && (\n                <div className="absolute right-0 mt-2 w-48 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-xl py-1 border border-slate-200">\n                  <a href="#" className="block px-4 py-2 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100">My Profile</a>\n                  <a href="#" className="block px-4 py-2 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100">Settings</a>\n                  <div className="my-1 border-t border-slate-200"></div>\n                  <a href="#" className="block px-4 py-2 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100">Log Out</a>\n                </div>\n              )}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n  );\n};\n\nconst PostCard: FC<{ post: Post; onPostSelect: (post: Post) => void }> = ({ post, onPostSelect }) => (\n  <div\n    onClick={() => onPostSelect(post)}\n    className="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all cursor-pointer"\n  >\n    <div className="flex items-start justify-between">\n        <div>\n            <span className="inline-block bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-full mb-2">{post.category}</span>\n            <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 hover:text-slate-900">{post.title}</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div className="flex items-center space-x-2 text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0 ml-4">\n            <MessageSquare className="w-4 h-4" />\n            <span>{post.replies.length}</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div className="flex items-center space-x-3 text-sm text-slate-500 mt-4">\n      <Avatar user={post.author} />\n      <span className="font-medium text-slate-600">{post.author.name}</span>\n      <span>&bull;</span>\n      <span>{post.timestamp}</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n);\n\nconst NewPostModal: FC<{ onClose: () => void; onPostSubmit: (post: Omit<Post, \'id\' | \'author\' | \'timestamp\' | \'replies\'>) => void }> = ({ onClose, onPostSubmit }) => {\n    const [title, setTitle] = useState(\'\');\n    const [content, setContent] = useState(\'\');\n    const [category, setCategory] = useState<Category>(\'General\');\n\n    const handleSubmit = (e: React.FormEvent) => {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        if (title.trim() && content.trim()) {\n            onPostSubmit({ title, content, category });\n        }\n    };\n\n    return (\n        <div className="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4" onClick={onClose}>\n            <div className="bg-white w-full max-w-2xl rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-8 relative" onClick={e => e.stopPropagation()}>\n                <button onClick={onClose} className="absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600">\n                    <X className="w-6 h-6" />\n                </button>\n                <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6">Create a New Post</h2>\n                <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className="space-y-6">\n                    <div>\n                        <label htmlFor="title" className="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">Title</label>\n                        <input\n                            id="title"\n                            type="text"\n                            value={title}\n                            onChange={e => setTitle(e.target.value)}\n                            placeholder=\'e.g. "How to improve my React skills?"\'\n                            className="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 outline-none transition"\n                            required\n                        />\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <label htmlFor="category" className="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">Category</label>\n                        <select\n                            id="category"\n                            value={category}\n                            onChange={e => setCategory(e.target.value as Category)}\n                            className="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 outline-none transition bg-white"\n                        >\n                            {CATEGORIES.map(cat => <option key={cat} value={cat}>{cat}</option>)}\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <label htmlFor="content" className="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">Content</label>\n                        <textarea\n                            id="content"\n                            value={content}\n                            onChange={e => setContent(e.target.value)}\n                            rows={8}\n                            placeholder="Write your post content here. Markdown is supported."\n                            className="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 outline-none transition resize-y"\n                            required\n                        />\n                    </div>\n                    <div className="flex justify-end pt-2">\n                        <button type="submit" className="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-700 text-white rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-sm disabled:bg-slate-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">\n                            Post Discussion\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    );\n};\n\nconst PostDetailCard: FC<{ post: Post; onBack: () => void; onReplySubmit: (postId: number, content: string) => void }> = ({ post, onBack, onReplySubmit }) => {\n    const [replyContent, setReplyContent] = useState(\'\');\n\n    const handleReply = () => {\n        if (replyContent.trim()) {\n            onReplySubmit(post.id, replyContent);\n            setReplyContent(\'\');\n        }\n    }\n\n    return (\n        <div className="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">\n            <button onClick={onBack} className="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 font-medium mb-6">\n                <ArrowLeft className="w-5 h-5" />\n                Back to all posts\n            </button>\n\n            {/* Post Details Card */}\n            <span className="inline-block bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-full mb-2">{post.category}</span>\n            <h1 className="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">{post.title}</h1>\n            <div className="flex items-center space-x-4 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200">\n                <Avatar user={post.author} />\n                <div>\n                    <p className="font-semibold text-slate-700">{post.author.name}</p>\n                    <p>Posted {post.timestamp}</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Post Content Card */}\n            <div className="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700">\n                <p>{post.content}</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className="mt-10">\n                <h3 className="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4">Replies ({post.replies.length})</h3>\n                <div className="space-y-6">\n                    {post.replies.map(reply => (\n                        <div key={reply.id} className="flex items-start space-x-4">\n                            <Avatar user={reply.author} />\n                            <div className="flex-1">\n                                <div className="flex items-center justify-between">\n                                    <div>\n                                        <span className="font-semibold text-slate-800">{reply.author.name}</span>\n                                        <span className="text-sm text-slate-500 ml-2"> &bull; {reply.timestamp}</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <button className="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700 text-sm">\n                                        <ThumbsUp className="w-4 h-4" />\n                                        <span>{reply.likes}</span>\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n                                <p className="text-slate-700 mt-1">{reply.content}</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    ))}\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">\n                <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3">Add your reply</h3>\n                <div className="flex items-start space-x-4">\n                    <Avatar user={defaultUser} />\n                    <div className="flex-1">\n                        <textarea\n                            value={replyContent}\n                            onChange={e => setReplyContent(e.target.value)}\n                            rows={3}\n                            placeholder="Share your thoughts..."\n                            className="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 outline-none transition resize-y"\n                        />\n                        <button onClick={handleReply} className="mt-3 px-5 py-2 bg-slate-700 text-white rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-sm disabled:bg-slate-400">\n                            Post Reply\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    );\n};\n\n// --- MAIN PAGE COMPONENT --- //\n\nconst ForumHubPage: NextPage = () => {\n  const [posts, setPosts] = useState<Post[]>(initialPosts);\n  const [selectedCategory, setSelectedCategory] = useState<Category | \'All\'>(\'All\');\n  const [searchTerm, setSearchTerm] = useState(\'\');\n  const [isModalOpen, setModalOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [selectedPost, setSelectedPost] = useState<Post | null>(null);\n\n  const filteredPosts = useMemo(() => {\n    return posts\n      .filter(post => selectedCategory === \'All\' || post.category === selectedCategory)\n      .filter(post => \n        post.title.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm.toLowerCase()) || \n        post.content.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm.toLowerCase())\n      );\n  }, [posts, selectedCategory, searchTerm]);\n\n  const handleNewPost = (newPostData: Omit<Post, \'id\' | \'author\' | \'timestamp\' | \'replies\'>) => {\n    const newPost: Post = {\n      ...newPostData,\n      id: Date.now(),\n      author: defaultUser,\n      timestamp: \'Just now\',\n      replies: [],\n    };\n    setPosts([newPost, ...posts]);\n    setModalOpen(false);\n  };\n\n  const handleNewReply = (postId: number, content: string) => {\n    const newReply: Reply = {\n        id: Date.now(),\n        author: defaultUser,\n        content,\n        timestamp: \'Just now\',\n        likes: 0\n    };\n\n    const updatedPosts = posts.map(p => {\n        if (p.id === postId) {\n            const updatedReplies = [...p.replies, newReply];\n            return { ...p, replies: updatedReplies };\n        }\n        return p;\n    });\n    setPosts(updatedPosts);\n\n    if (selectedPost && selectedPost.id === postId) {\n        setSelectedPost(prev => prev ? { ...prev, replies: [...prev.replies, newReply] } : null);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 font-sans text-slate-800">\n      <Header onNewPostClick={() => setModalOpen(true)} searchTerm={searchTerm} setSearchTerm={setSearchTerm} />\n\n      <main className="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">\n        {selectedPost ? (\n          <PostDetailCard post={selectedPost} onBack={() => setSelectedPost(null)} onReplySubmit={handleNewReply} />\n        ) : (\n          <>\n            <div className="mb-6">\n              <h1 className="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">Discussions</h1>\n              <p className="text-slate-500">Browse topics, ask questions, and share your knowledge.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-8">\n              <button\n                onClick={() => setSelectedCategory(\'All\')}\n                className={cn(\n                  \'px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-colors\',\n                  selectedCategory === \'All\' ? \'bg-slate-700 text-white\' : \'bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200\'\n                )}\n              >\n                All\n              </button>\n              {CATEGORIES.map(category => (\n                <button\n                  key={category}\n                  onClick={() => setSelectedCategory(category)}\n                  className={cn(\n                    \'px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-colors\',\n                    selectedCategory === category ? \'bg-slate-700 text-white\' : \'bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200\'\n                  )}\n                >\n                  {category}\n                </button>\n              ))}\n            </div>\n\n            <div className="grid gap-6">\n              {filteredPosts.map(post => (\n                <PostCard key={post.id} post={post} onPostSelect={setSelectedPost} />\n              ))}\n            </div>\n          </>\n        )}\n      </main>\n\n      <footer className="bg-slate-100 border-t border-slate-200 mt-12">\n        <div className="container mx-auto px-4 py-6 text-center text-slate-500 text-sm">\n          &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Forum Hub. All rights reserved.\n        </div>\n      </footer>\n\n      {isModalOpen && <NewPostModal onClose={() => setModalOpen(false)} onPostSubmit={handleNewPost} />}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default ForumHubPage;\n'}

